      "content": "idk if i can \"heal\" from this. once people see you like this, once the reputation is dead, you can't just go back. i feel like i'm just waiting for the humiliation to finish. i'm just waiting for that moment when i'm at my absolute lowest, absolute nothing, and everyone's just looking down at me with that pathetic pity. it's not just sadness, it's like... i've lost my place in the world. there's no way to fix this. it's just a long, slow crawl to the bottom.",
